  "content": "<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1462/847/linesus1ex-png.png\" alt=\"LineSus1ex.png\" width=\"849\" height=\"100\">參與 Forge the Future：<br>Minecraft ModJam 2025<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1462/848/linesus2ex-png.png\" alt=\"LineSus2ex.png\"></h3><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">部分材質已改為次世代主題。&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">部分未改為次世代，但已改為我喜歡的風格 :)</h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1739/309/allspritessheet-export-png.png\" alt=\"0.42\"></p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">目前所有材質</h3><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1462/849/linesus3ex-png.png\" alt=\"LineSus3\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">所有金屬工具在手持時皆帶有動畫</h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1350944/description_7b830116-6ea4-40cd-81a9-89cab2a6de48.gif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1350944/description_ece50a32-32eb-441c-9520-3f0d9cfc3875.gif\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1350944/description_80a85455-aa1f-46e7-b5f0-d28e29c3cda9.gif\" width=\"206\" height=\"206\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1462/848/linesus2ex-png.png\" alt=\"物品圖片\"></p>",
